{"unit_id":"zk-wz__dsh-workbuddy-broadcast#card-zh","repo":"zk-wz/dsh-workbuddy-broadcast","commit":"ca6b9a6fab4f3734b4e89fe98aabf479eb166069","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH WorkBuddy Broadcast（DSH Web 插件）：将本机已登录的 WorkBuddy 账号提供为 OpenAI 兼容 HTTP 服务。它读取登录凭据和模型目录，提供 Bearer 鉴权的模型列表及 SSE 聊天补全，并带有查看状态、复制密钥、修改端口的设置页。Windows 可监听 WSL 虚拟网卡和本机回环地址；macOS、Linux 使用回环地址。适合让其他兼容客户端复用 WorkBuddy 模型。需要已登录的 WorkBuddy 与同一 profile 内的 dsh-workbuddy-connect；密钥可自动生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:335-425","lib/index.js:548-567","lib/index.js:601-727"]}
